1
00:00:00,905 --> 00:00:02,945
(Leonard:)So, what do you guys think?

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,540
No, pretty much any way I say that
is gonna hurt his feelings.

3
00:00:11,624 --> 00:00:13,204
(Leonard:)Okay, what's wrong with it?

4
00:00:13,376 --> 00:00:16,046
(Leonard:)- What's wrong with it?
- Not you. I wasn't asking you.

5
00:00:17,588 --> 00:00:20,798
(Leonard:)- Penny?
- Well, it's a little juvenile.

6
00:00:20,966 --> 00:00:25,266
(Penny:)I mean, it kind of looks like
the MySpace page of a 13-year-old girl.

7
00:00:25,763 --> 00:00:27,263
(Leonard:)No, it doesn't.

8
00:00:27,431 --> 00:00:31,391
(Howard:)Please. Dateline could use it
to attract predators.

9
00:00:33,938 --> 00:00:37,978
(Sheldon:)Penny, this is your enterprise,
so it's ultimately your decision.

10
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:41,070
(Sheldon:)But based on the quality of his work,
I'd strongly recommend...

11
00:00:41,237 --> 00:00:43,237
(Sheldon:)...that we let Leonard go.

12
00:00:43,656 --> 00:00:45,036
You wanna fire me?

13
00:00:45,199 --> 00:00:48,739
(Sheldon:)What I want is irrelevant.
This is Penny's decision.

14
00:00:48,911 --> 00:00:50,621
(Leonard:)Penny?

15
00:00:50,788 --> 00:00:54,128
Excuse me, if I did such a bad job,
then why do we already have orders?

